#: pages/views.py
msgid "Too many messages have been sent from here recently. Please try again later."
msgstr "Der er sendt for mange beskeder herfra for nylig. Prøv venligst igen senere."

msgid ""
"Your message was received, but the confirmation email could not be sent. Please get in "
"touch directly if you don't hear back."
msgstr ""
"Din besked er modtaget, men bekræftelsesmailen kunne ikke sendes. Skriv gerne direkte, "
"hvis du ikke hører fra mig."

#: templates/galleries/locked.html
msgid "Private gallery"
msgstr "Privat galleri"

